WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:10.537
The arrow pointed out of the shipwreck.

2
00:00:10.538 --> 00:00:16.739
"Let's keep following it," Cora said.

3
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.744
The arrow led them to another dark place.

4
00:00:20.745 --> 00:00:24.348
Cora saw little flickers of light.

5
00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:27.301
The arrow stopped.

6
00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:33.886
"Are those more jellyfish?" Mo asked.

7
00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:38.976
"No, they're glowworms!" Cora said.

8
00:00:38.977 --> 00:00:43.453
"Why is the arrow pointing at them?" Mo said.

9
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:49.576
Cora shrugged. "I don't know, but maybe . . ."

10
00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:52.446
She held up the old lantern.

11
00:00:52.447 --> 00:00:57.364
"Do you think we need to collect glowworms?"

12
00:00:57.365 --> 00:01:02.578
"What?" Mo laughed. "That sounds crazy!

13
00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:05.027
Why would we do that?"

14
00:01:05.028 --> 00:01:09.585
"I don't know," Cora said.

15
00:01:09.586 --> 00:01:13.019
"But the arrow is pointing to them.

16
00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.985
Let's try it!"

17
00:01:15.986 --> 00:01:22.764
Cora began collecting glowworms.

18
00:01:22.765 --> 00:01:25.444
Mo chased some too.

19
00:01:25.445 --> 00:01:36.339
But he was much slower than Cora.

20
00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:40.182
Then Mo spotted a big glowworm.

21
00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.388
It was moving very slowly.

22
00:01:43.389 --> 00:01:47.661
"I can catch that one!" he thought.

23
00:01:47.662 --> 00:01:51.994
Mo zoomed as fast as he could.

24
00:01:51.995 --> 00:01:58.012
"Got you!" he cried.

25
00:01:58.013 --> 00:02:00.903
The creature spun around.

26
00:02:00.904 --> 00:02:04.756
But it was not a glowworm.

27
00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:08.574
"Help!" Mo cried.

28
00:02:08.575 --> 00:02:11.207
Cora spun around.

29
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:15.930
She saw a glowing anglerfish—with sharp teeth!

